## 6. Architecture Quality Assessment

### Strengths ✅

1. **Clean Separation**: [ConfigSync.tsx](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/client/src/live/ConfigSync.tsx) handles all WebSocket cache invalidation centrally
2. **Type Safety**: Full TypeScript coverage with proper interfaces
3. **Shared Contracts**: [shared/quoteSubscriptions.ts](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/shared/quoteSubscriptions.ts) defines Zod schemas used by both client and server
4. **Defensive Coding**: Dialogs auto-close when `supportsCustom` becomes false
5. **Accessibility**: Aria labels on icon buttons

### Areas for Improvement

1. **No debounced search** in SymbolSubscriptionDialog
2. **No error boundary** around subscription flows
3. **No optimistic updates** for better UX (saves are synchronous)
4. **No loading skeleton** in subscriptions list during save

---

