## 8. Conclusion

The quote customization feature is **production-ready** with minor refinements needed for optimal performance and maintainability. The core user flows are complete:

1. ✅ Traders can see + and pen icons when mode supports custom
2. ✅ Icons disappear instantly when admin disables customization
3. ✅ Add symbol flow works end-to-end
4. ✅ Remove symbol flow works end-to-end
5. ⚠️ Search debounce missing (performance concern)
6. ❌ Test coverage absent (maintenance concern)

The implementation correctly deviates from the plan by using [ConfigSync.tsx](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/client/src/live/ConfigSync.tsx) instead of modifying [LiveUpdatesProvider.tsx](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/client/src/live/LiveUpdatesProvider.tsx), which is a better architectural choice. The task.md checklist needs updating to reflect actual completed work.
